1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,100
Stop saying important.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,720
Use the word The Economist actually uses.

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,990
The word is consequential.

4
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,740
It doesn't just mean matters.

5
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,150
It means this will have consequences.

6
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,980
This decision carries weight because

7
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,230
of what happens next.

8
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:16,570
In your next email,

9
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:18,320
replace "this is important" with

10
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,990
"this is a consequential decision."

11
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:21,900
Same meaning,

12
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,950
sharper signal.

13
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,140
Consequential.

14
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,350
If you're upper-intermediate or advanced,

15
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:28,500
and you want more speaking practice,

16
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,960
join The English Edge,

17
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,740
my conversation community.

18
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,670
Try it free for 7 days.

19
